---
import GoatCounter from '../../components/GoatCounter.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="A sculpted relief map of eastern Australia's Great Dividing Range and Australian Alps."/><title>The Great Divide | Geospatial Sandbox</title><link rel="icon" href={base + '/favicon.svg'}/><GoatCounter/></head><body>
<header><a href={base + '/'}>← Portfolio</a><span>AN EASTERN AUSTRALIAN TERRAIN STUDY</span></header><main>
<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">QUEENSLAND · NEW SOUTH WALES · VICTORIA</p><h1>The Great <em>Divide</em></h1></div><div><p class="lead">A sculpted view of the mountains, tablelands and river valleys of eastern Australia, from tropical Queensland to the Australian Alps.</p><span class="intro-note">INTERACTIVE RELIEF MAP <b> / </b> 142°–154° E</span></div></section>
<section class="map-shell" aria-label="Great Dividing Range relief map"><div class="toolbar"><div><strong>THE GREAT DIVIDING RANGE</strong><span>Drag to explore · Scroll to zoom</span></div><div class="buttons"><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button id="reset">Reset</button></div></div>
<div id="viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Interactive map of eastern Australia. Drag to pan; use plus and minus buttons to zoom."><div id="map"><div id="viewer"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 600 1200" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><pattern id="grid" x="0" y="0" width="100" height="100" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 100 0 L 0 0 0 100" fill="none" stroke="#776e5b" stroke-width=".7" opacity=".28"/></pattern></defs><rect width="600" height="1200" fill="url(#grid)"/><g fill="#554e42" font-family="Georgia,serif" font-size="13" letter-spacing="3" opacity=".72"><text x="48" y="395">QUEENSLAND</text><text x="54" y="852">NEW SOUTH WALES</text><text x="70" y="1126">VICTORIA</text></g><g fill="#464239" font-family="Georgia,serif" font-style="italic" font-size="12"><text x="160" y="628">Great Dividing Range</text><text x="154" y="1082">Australian Alps</text><text x="453" y="938" text-anchor="end">Sydney</text><text x="543" y="619" text-anchor="end">Brisbane</text><text x="156" y="1152">Melbourne</text></g><g fill="#9d5e3b"><circle cx="460" cy="943" r="2.8"/><circle cx="551" cy="624" r="2.8"/><circle cx="148" cy="1140" r="2.8"/></g><text x="460" y="350" fill="#667879" font-family="Georgia,serif" font-style="italic" font-size="15" letter-spacing="2">PACIFIC</text><text x="470" y="376" fill="#667879" font-family="Georgia,serif" font-style="italic" font-size="15" letter-spacing="2">OCEAN</text></svg><div class="map-title"><span>EASTERN AUSTRALIA</span><strong>THE GREAT<br/>DIVIDE</strong><small>Relief of the eastern highlands</small></div><div class="compass">N<br/><span>↑</span></div><div class="map-footer"><span>142° E</span><span>RELIEF EXAGGERATED 25×</span><span>154° E</span></div></div><div id="status" role="status">Building the landscape…</div></div>
<div class="map-caption"><span>15° S — 39° S &nbsp; / &nbsp; 142° E — 154° E</span><span>GEOSPATIAL SANDBOX</span></div></section>
<section class="story"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE LANDSCAPE</p><h2>One long, complex highland.</h2></div><div><p>The Great Dividing Range is a chain of ranges, plateaus and escarpments stretching along eastern Australia. This map follows the highlands south from Queensland to the Australian Alps.</p><p>The terrain is deliberately exaggerated and illuminated from the north-west to make broad patterns visible at this scale. The river network and coastline are generalised for the overview.</p><div class="facts"><div><strong>~2 km</strong><span>Display grid</span></div><div><strong>25×</strong><span>Vertical exaggeration</span></div><div><strong>15°–39° S</strong><span>Latitude</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sources"><h2>Sources &amp; credits</h2><p>Elevation: <a href="https://pid.geoscience.gov.au/dataset/ga/72759">Geoscience Australia, Digital Elevation Model of Australia with 1 Second Grid</a> (SRTM-derived ground elevation), © Commonwealth of Australia (Geoscience Australia), CC BY 4.0. The elevation grid has been resampled to 0.02° for this overview; the display spacing varies with latitude. Coastline and rivers: Natural Earth 1:10m physical data, public domain.</p><p>Relief is vertically exaggerated and the projection is approximated for this artwork. This map is not for navigation.</p></section></main>
<script>
import * as THREE from 'three';
const viewer=document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#viewer')!,viewport=document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#viewport')!,map=document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#map')!,status=document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('#status')!;
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,''); let zoom=1, dx=0,dy=0;
function move(){map.style.transform=`translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(${zoom})`;}
function setZoom(z:number){zoom=Math.max(1,Math.min(4,z));if(zoom===1){dx=0;dy=0}move()}
document.querySelector('#zoom-in')!.addEventListener('click',()=>setZoom(zoom*1.35));document.querySelector('#zoom-out')!.addEventListener('click',()=>setZoom(zoom/1.35));document.querySelector('#reset')!.addEventListener('click',()=>setZoom(1));
viewport.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{e.preventDefault();setZoom(zoom*(e.deltaY<0?1.15:1/1.15))},{passive:false});let drag=false,lastX=0,lastY=0;
viewport.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(zoom<=1)return;drag=true;lastX=e.clientX;lastY=e.clientY;viewport.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)});viewport.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!drag)return;dx+=e.clientX-lastX;dy+=e.clientY-lastY;lastX=e.clientX;lastY=e.clientY;move()});viewport.addEventListener('pointerup',()=>drag=false);viewport.addEventListener('pointercancel',()=>drag=false);
try{
 const scene=new THREE.Scene(); const camera=new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-5.5,5.5,12.1,-12.1,.01,80);camera.position.set(0,35,0);camera.up.set(0,0,-1);camera.lookAt(0,0,0);
 const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,alpha:true});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,1.5));renderer.outputColorSpace=THREE.SRGBColorSpace;renderer.setClearColor(0x000000,0);viewer.appendChild(renderer.domElement);
 scene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0xf3ddbb,1.25));const sun=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffe6bd,3.2);sun.position.set(-18,13,-18);scene.add(sun);
 function resize(){renderer.setSize(viewer.clientWidth,viewer.clientHeight);renderer.render(scene,camera)}new ResizeObserver(resize).observe(viewer);resize();
 Promise.all(['divide-height.f32','divide-mask.bin','divide-rivers.bin'].map(n=>fetch(base+'/data/'+n).then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error();return r.arrayBuffer()}))).then(([h,m,r])=>{
  const heights=new Float32Array(h),mask=new Uint8Array(m),rivers=new Uint8Array(r),cols=600,rows=1200;if(heights.length!==cols*rows||mask.length!==cols*rows)throw Error();
  const positions=new Float32Array(cols*rows*3), colors=new Float32Array(cols*rows*3);const low=new THREE.Color('#b8a47e'),high=new THREE.Color('#e5d5b4'), river=new THREE.Color('#7e9b9c');let indices:number[]=[];
  for(let y=0;y<rows;y++)for(let x=0;x<cols;x++){const i=y*cols+x,k=i*3;const elev=Math.max(0,heights[i]);positions[k]=(x/(cols-1)-.5)*10.69;positions[k+1]=elev/111320*25;positions[k+2]=(y/(rows-1)-.5)*24;const c=low.clone().lerp(high,Math.min(elev/1900,1)*.75);if(rivers[i])c.lerp(river,.65);colors[k]=c.r;colors[k+1]=c.g;colors[k+2]=c.b;}
  for(let y=0;y<rows-1;y++)for(let x=0;x<cols-1;x++){const i=y*cols+x;if(mask[i]&&mask[i+1]&&mask[i+cols])indices.push(i,i+cols,i+1);if(mask[i+1]&&mask[i+cols]&&mask[i+cols+1])indices.push(i+1,i+cols,i+cols+1)}
  const geometry=new THREE.BufferGeometry();geometry.setAttribute('position',new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions,3));geometry.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(colors,3));geometry.setIndex(indices);geometry.computeVertexNormals();const material=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({vertexColors:true,roughness:1,side:THREE.DoubleSide});scene.add(new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material));status.hidden=true;resize();
 }).catch(()=>{status.textContent='The elevation data could not be loaded. Please refresh to try again.'});
}catch{status.textContent='The 3D viewer needs a browser with WebGL enabled.';}
</script>
<style>
:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){margin:0;background:#11191a;color:#f1e9d9;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}:global(a){color:inherit}header{height:76px;padding:0 5vw;border-bottom:1px solid #3c4945;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#aeb8ae}header a{color:#e9c296;letter-spacing:0;text-decoration:none;font-size:1rem}main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:0 5vw 90px}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;align-items:end;gap:7vw;padding:70px 0 52px}.eyebrow{color:#d8aa75;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.17em}.intro h1{font:400 clamp(4.6rem,10vw,9rem)/.84 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:24px 0 0}.intro em{font-weight:400;color:#d9ad7d}.lead{color:#bcc6bd;max-width:480px;font-size:1.13rem;line-height:1.65}.intro-note{display:block;color:#94a59b;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em;margin-top:30px}.intro-note b{color:#d2a477}.map-shell{border:1px solid #59625a;background:#1b2523}.toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:19px 24px;gap:20px}.toolbar strong{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.14em}.toolbar span{display:block;color:#aeb9ae;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:6px}.buttons{display:flex;gap:7px}.buttons button{background:#263631;border:1px solid #69786b;color:#eee2ce;padding:8px 13px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.buttons button:hover{background:#3b4d43}#viewport{position:relative;overflow:hidden;height:min(1150px,130vw);min-height:560px;background:#b4a58d;touch-action:none;cursor:grab}#viewport:active{cursor:grabbing}#map{position:absolute;height:100%;aspect-ratio:10.69/24;left:50%;top:0;translate:-50% 0;transform-origin:center center;background:#ddd0b7;box-shadow:0 12px 55px #382e25a0;overflow:hidden}#viewer,#map svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}#viewer canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}#map svg{pointer-events:none}.map-title{position:absolute;top:3.8%;left:7%;color:#554a3d;border-top:1px solid #887961;padding-top:9px;pointer-events:none}.map-title span,.map-title small{display:block;font-size:clamp(5px,.6vw,9px);letter-spacing:.16em}.map-title strong{display:block;font:400 clamp(13px,2vw,28px)/.95 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:6px 0}.compass{position:absolute;right:8%;top:4%;color:#655745;font:12px Georgia;text-align:center;pointer-events:none}.compass span{font-size:24px}.map-footer{position:absolute;bottom:2%;left:5%;right:5%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#6c5e4f;font-size:clamp(4px,.6vw,8px);letter-spacing:.09em;pointer-events:none}#status{position:absolute;left:20px;bottom:20px;background:#14201fdf;color:#f5ebd8;padding:12px}.map-caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:16px 22px;color:#aeb9ae;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.13em}.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:8vw;padding:90px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #3b4944}.story h2,.sources h2{font:400 clamp(2.8rem,5vw,4.5rem)/1 Georgia,serif;margin:16px 0}.story p,.sources p{color:#bec9bf;line-height:1.7;font-size:1.05rem}.facts{display:flex;gap:35px;margin-top:38px}.facts div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.facts strong{font:400 1.7rem Georgia,serif;color:#ead1ae}.facts span{color:#aab5ae;font-size:.85rem}.sources{max-width:920px;padding-top:60px}.sources h2{font-size:2.3rem}.sources p{font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:800px){header{padding:0 20px}header span{display:none}main{padding:0 20px 60px}.intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;padding:50px 0 34px}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,15vw,7rem)}.toolbar{padding:15px;align-items:start}.toolbar span{max-width:170px;line-height:1.4}#viewport{height:140vw;min-height:500px;max-height:820px}.map-caption{font-size:.6rem}.story{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;padding:60px 0}.facts{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:25px}}
</style></body></html>

